# Corpus snapshots carry recorded per-file digests over their RAW bytes
# (see docs/specs/content-hash.md and pipeline/corpus/index.json). Git must
# never translate their line endings, or the file-digest integrity check in
# `intake verify` fails on checkout.
pipeline/corpus/** -text

# Force LF line endings everywhere — prevents CRLF breakage on Windows
# (core.autocrlf=true converts on checkout, breaking byte-for-byte tests)
* text=auto eol=lf
